             OR PB-HS-ADDED-COUNT < 0 OR PB-HS-ADDED-COUNT > PB-HS-MAX-COMPONENTS
             OR PB-HS-REMOVED-COUNT < 0 OR PB-HS-REMOVED-COUNT > PB-HS-MAX-COMPONENTS
